# Durable Recent Course acceptance, source run. Reach an authoritative stock
# race through ordinary guest input with a named Modern profile active, let
# the host observe the validated course, then quit before any results
# autosave. Addresses are WRAM offsets (7E:xxxx -> xxxx).

until 009F == D7 3600
wait 60
press a 2

until 009F == 3C 1200
wait 60
press a 2

until 009F == 6D 1200
wait 60
press a 2

until 009F == F6 1200
wait 60
press a 2

until 009F != F6 1200
until 009F == 16 1200
wait 60
press a 2

until 0313 == 01 1800
wait 60
dump recent-persist-race
quit
